ostiole-proxy is Caddy with three modules compiled in. All are Apache-2.0.

Caddy                 https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy
Coraza                https://github.com/corazawaf/coraza
coraza-caddy          https://github.com/corazawaf/coraza-caddy
OWASP Core Rule Set   https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset
caddy-l4              https://github.com/mholt/caddy-l4
